<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Pati8.81">
        <l>poyyil celvak kaṭuṅkō vukku</l>
        <l>vēḷāvik kōmāṉ patumaṉ ṟēviyīṉṟamakaṉ</l>
        <l>kollik kūṟṟattu nīrkūr mīmicaip</l>
        <l>palvēṟ ṟāṉai yatika māṉō</l>
        <l>ṭiruperu vēntaraiyu muṭaṉilai veṉṟu</l>
        <l>muracuṅ kuṭaiyuṅ kalaṉuṅkoṇ</l>
        <l>ṭuraicāl ciṟappi ṉaṭukaḷam vēṭṭut</l>
        <l>tukaṭīr makaḷi riraṅkat tuppaṟuttut</l>
        <l>takaṭū reṟintu noccitan teytiya</l>
        <l>varuntiṟa loḷḷicaip peruñcēra lirumpoṟaiyai</l>
        <l>maṟuvil vāymoḻi y<persName>aricilkiḻār</persName> pāṭiṉār pattuppāṭṭu.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>translation line</l>
        <l>translation line</l>
      </lg>
    </div>

    <div rend="parallel">
    <p xml:id="Pati8.81coda1">
      avaitām: kuṟuntāṇñāyil, urutteḻuveḷḷam, niṟantikaḻpāciḻai, nalampeṟutirumaṇi, tīñcēṟṟiyāṇar, mācitaṟirukkai, veṉṟāṭutuṇaṅkai, piṟaḻanōkkiyavar, niṟampaṭukuruti, puṇṇuṭaiyeṟuḻttōḷ ivai pāṭṭiṉ patikam.
     </p>
     <p xml:lang="en">translation</p>
    </div>
    
    <div rend="parallel">
     <p xml:id="Pati8.81coda2">
      pāṭippeṟṟa paricil: tāṉum kōyilāḷum puṟampōntu niṉṟu kōyi luḷḷa vellām koṇmiṉeṉṟu kāṇam oṉpatu nūṟāyirattoṭu aracu kaṭṭiṟ koṭuppa avar yāṉ irappa vataṉai yāṇmiṉeṉṟu amaiccup pūṇṭār. takaṭūreṟinta peruṅcēralirumpoṟai patiṉēḻiyāṇṭu vīṟṟiruntāṉ.
     </p>
     <p xml:lang="en">translation</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>

